-- Read-only baseline capture for a non-positional root (SITE / BRAN / PIPE container).
-- Replace {{TARGET_NAME}} and {{LOG_PATH}}.
-- Deliberately omits POS/ORI/DESC/PURP: unsupported Q attributes can abort E3D before the log flushes.
ALPHA LOG "{{LOG_PATH}}" OVER
$P AMS-INPLACE-ROOT-BASELINE-ALIVE
{{WORLD_ANCHOR}}
{{TARGET_NAME}}
Q REF
Q NAME
Q TYPE
Q OWNE
$P AMS-INPLACE-ROOT-BASELINE-DONE
ALPHA LOG END
